          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Warts: all are caused by HPV - most resolve w.o tx over 2yrs - MC in children & y/a - spread by direct contact - common warts = HPV types 2 & 4 - warts = MC clin manifestation of HPV - >200 subtypes - HPV 1 → plantar warts · 6 & 11 → anogenital · 16 & 18 → most cervical & anal CA (31 · 33 · 42 · 52 · 58 also malig) - HPV-assoc oropharyngeal CA = SCC - spread thru compromised skin or mucous membranes - warts themselves infectious"
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       },
